  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "1. +, -, +, ÷, =\n\n76 + 34 - 23 + __**12 ÷ 6**__ = 21 \n\n⇒ __**76 + 34**__ - 23 __**+ 2**__ = 21\n\n⇒ __**112 - 23**__ = 21\n\n⇒ 89 ≠ 21 \n\n2. -, -, +, +, = \n\n__**76**__ - 34 - 23 __**+ 12 + 6**__ = 21 \n\n⇒ 94 __**- 34 - 23**__ = 21 \n\n⇒ __**94**____** - 57**__ = 21 \n\n⇒ 37 ≠ 21 \n\n3. ×, -, +, ÷, =\n\n__**76 × 34**__ - 23 + __**12 ÷ 6**__ = 21 \n\n⇒ __**2584**__ - 23 __**+ 2**__ = 21\n\n⇒ __**2586 - 23**__ = 21\n\n⇒ 2563 ≠ 21\n\n4. -, -, +, ÷, = \n\n76 - 34 - 23 + __**12 ÷ 6**__ = 21\n\n⇒ __**76**__ - 34 - 23 __**+**____** 2**__ = 21\n\n⇒ 78 __**-**____** 34 -**____** 23**__ = 21\n\n⇒ __**78 **-____ 57__ = 21\n\n⇒ 21 = 21\n\nHence, '**-, -, +, ÷, =**' is the correct answer.",
